        $documents = [
            [
                'id' => 1,
                'title' => "AGM Minutes Update ",
                'slug' => "agm-minutes-update",
                'content' => "<h1 id=\"update-agm-date-on-stratamaster\">Update AGM Date on StrataMaster</h1><ol start=\"1\"><li><p>Check date of meeting on AGM Minutes</p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/BW4X9Qqre5UjeOMIkDeciEiby0kxpQoahhabFDGg.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/BW4X9Qqre5UjeOMIkDeciEiby0kxpQoahhabFDGg.png\"></p></li><li><p>Enter date from the above into StrataMaster</p></li><li><p>Go to <img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/dJ4WF8rlqBjCBgX67hsvpnip7nr2sTH4ZNn9xTq9.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/dJ4WF8rlqBjCBgX67hsvpnip7nr2sTH4ZNn9xTq9.png\"> and enter PS number. Select ‘Financial’ tab and edit by pressing <img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/5kzrgXpljmFwJV4XeMutWYM3dqFDEcmws8lyfvlF.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/5kzrgXpljmFwJV4XeMutWYM3dqFDEcmws8lyfvlF.png\"> Input date into ‘Last AGM’ and then save by pressing <img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/5u2Ck1lCRV45hrgAd1BMw8xwxUbLWro1Pmze0RQy.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/5u2Ck1lCRV45hrgAd1BMw8xwxUbLWro1Pmze0RQy.png\">.</p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/HsltemlB8EXpHGfLnQUo1xUJomF1YSCHei8QRkUo.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/HsltemlB8EXpHGfLnQUo1xUJomF1YSCHei8QRkUo.png\"></p></li></ol><hr><h1 id=\"rollover-financial-year-end-date\">Rollover Financial Year End Date</h1><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/mjOmqlPKp6UNurFYTW1t9JAizIQgfnNMvrFo7sCN.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/mjOmqlPKp6UNurFYTW1t9JAizIQgfnNMvrFo7sCN.png\"></p><ol start=\"1\"><li><p>If meeting date is past the Financial Year end date (as shown above), proceed with rollover.</p><ul><li><p><span data-color=\"red\" class=\"color\" style=\"--color: oklch(0.577 0.245 27.325); --dark-color: oklch(0.704 0.191 22.216)\">Example: Financial Year end date is showing 30/11/2024, but the AGM was held on 12/12/2024.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p>If meeting date is before the Financial Year end date (as shown above), DO NOT ROLLOVER and proceed to step 3.</p><ul><li><p><span data-color=\"red\" class=\"color\" style=\"--color: oklch(0.577 0.245 27.325); --dark-color: oklch(0.704 0.191 22.216)\">Example: Financial Year end date is showing 30/11/2024, but the AGM was held on 05/10/2024.</span></p></li></ul></li><li><p>StrataMaster → Accounting → End of Financial Year End Rollover</p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/DALXV9HvUrKeM4kVDw2ZYkAlyz1rA4fjOwnDEOJm.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/DALXV9HvUrKeM4kVDw2ZYkAlyz1rA4fjOwnDEOJm.png\"></p></li><li><p>Select Manager and press <img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/v7C9lEpAHeyol5O0dwmS3aMIMNolGN0ZLz342S0Z.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/v7C9lEpAHeyol5O0dwmS3aMIMNolGN0ZLz342S0Z.png\"></p></li><li><p>Select the PS Number and rollover the financial year by pressing <img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/CYck0o7MwrRrU1qiZg3zVGSe0AoEJQE5fPawoxn7.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/CYck0o7MwrRrU1qiZg3zVGSe0AoEJQE5fPawoxn7.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/2gNMH1hhbLJkksDE4xboiwNopFkkj97do6C8HflM.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/2gNMH1hhbLJkksDE4xboiwNopFkkj97do6C8HflM.png\"></p></li></ol><hr><h1 id=\"update-mocs-agency-fees-disbursements-amp-management-fees\">Update MOCS agency fees (Disbursements &amp; Management Fees)</h1><ol start=\"1\"><li><p>Check Budget for Management Fees &amp; Disbursements increase/decrease.</p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/Rp0iN5rEdsCEJ7fzIcVBKSQXUaGRgvhVRj1du8R3.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/Rp0iN5rEdsCEJ7fzIcVBKSQXUaGRgvhVRj1du8R3.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/5UkG3Xxf9g3DS7fOLiGPyBMjuaKN4x6BTJGm0RoV.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/5UkG3Xxf9g3DS7fOLiGPyBMjuaKN4x6BTJGm0RoV.png\"></p><ul><li><p>For GST registered OCs, amount shown above is annual and not including GST.</p></li><li><p>For non-GST registered OCs, amount shown above is annual and including GST.</p></li><li><p>If no increase/decrease for either Management Fees &amp; Disbursements, skip the below and proceed to step 4.</p></li><li><p>If there are increase/decrease for either Management Fees &amp; Disbursements, continue with below.</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Check Contract of Appointment (COA) for Management Fees and Disbursements amounts</p><ul><li><p>Z Drive → Buildings → Folder of OC → Contracts &amp; Agreements → OC Management → Open the latest COA PDF file</p></li><li><p>Check the ‘Term of Appointment’ section</p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/gfEhuDJocqdObTnAAiF3tUxA1tIIVNnGLY70NMT3.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/gfEhuDJocqdObTnAAiF3tUxA1tIIVNnGLY70NMT3.png\"></p></li><li><p>Check the Management Fee in COA (<span data-color=\"red\" class=\"color\" style=\"--color: oklch(0.577 0.245 27.325); --dark-color: oklch(0.704 0.191 22.216)\">amount is GST inclusive</span>)</p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/6ofauwL9V0RDxesm7Uqa8rhtu3QgeDx8NaguUYLT.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/6ofauwL9V0RDxesm7Uqa8rhtu3QgeDx8NaguUYLT.png\"></p></li><li><p>Check Disbursement amount in COA (amount is GST inclusive). As the below amount is for EACH lot, remember to multiply this amount by the number of lots in the OC. Number of lots is from StrataMaster</p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/WmoOz2G6FotSCWrg8xrr4wyjc6XVZVw3EbFY80Vm.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/WmoOz2G6FotSCWrg8xrr4wyjc6XVZVw3EbFY80Vm.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/7dfoR0PlvGl6JmhxzsoI2ryOL1A44mrJ7EeEdqTF.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/7dfoR0PlvGl6JmhxzsoI2ryOL1A44mrJ7EeEdqTF.png\"></p></li><li><p>If COA has expired, ignore the COA and make any adjustments to Management Fees &amp; Disbursements according to the Budget.</p></li><li><p>If COA has NOT expired:</p><ul><li><p>If Management Fees and/or Disbursements amount on Budget is LESS than COA, collect adjustment according to the COA. Let the OC Manager know that the Management Fees and/or Disbursements amount in their budget is less than the COA.</p></li><li><p>If Management Fees and/or Disbursements amount on Budget is MORE than COA, collect adjustment according to the Budget.</p></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><p>Open<img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/c4hVKBHmL5C56lfQEWhWYCHNkzsQa54FTEPGs0WL.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/c4hVKBHmL5C56lfQEWhWYCHNkzsQa54FTEPGs0WL.png\"> , and press <img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/mkgmSgU0qS9civC8m0Tb6JDFjx4OQVQqFBPZ1ZnG.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/mkgmSgU0qS9civC8m0Tb6JDFjx4OQVQqFBPZ1ZnG.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/G4xCct1pU1pxs2IJLHS2a70CXIpLK6AfDpcFpB0j.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/G4xCct1pU1pxs2IJLHS2a70CXIpLK6AfDpcFpB0j.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/NxPrJvsjcgLiwBO6H0ra0Q7v4ElpLbN1sh66R2uC.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/NxPrJvsjcgLiwBO6H0ra0Q7v4ElpLbN1sh66R2uC.png\"></p><ul><li><p>Amount shown above are monthly and includes GST regardless of whether the OC is GST registered</p></li><li><p>Click on the line item (Disbursement/Standard Management Fee) and press <img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/tbpzvWSxcMB7PDTylrv5gyKYxuzXunxSoEXjrSlb.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/tbpzvWSxcMB7PDTylrv5gyKYxuzXunxSoEXjrSlb.png\"> to edit.</p></li><li><p>Calculate the new monthly amount for Disbursement/Standard Management Fee from the annual budget, then enter to ‘Current Rate’ and ‘New Rate’.</p></li><li><p>Save changes by clicking on <img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/E2CZRZ8gaKJ7uhDWs55KDZcP8LZmOrK5VVaNB7p1.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/E2CZRZ8gaKJ7uhDWs55KDZcP8LZmOrK5VVaNB7p1.png\"></p></li></ul></li><li><p>If Disbursements and/or Management Fees decreased, email <a href=\"mailto:accounts@mocs.com.au\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">accounts@mocs.com.au</a> to refund the difference and proceed to step 4.</p></li><li><p>If Disbursements and/or Management Fees increased, follow below steps to charge it.</p><ul><li><p>StrataMaster → Accounting → Charge Quantity Management Fees</p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/2aiOKZakuFdl9vSdZ0yk5yn8scLKzRSQXpNcfgXj.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/2aiOKZakuFdl9vSdZ0yk5yn8scLKzRSQXpNcfgXj.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/qPZOrHwcnJbEjeibsxSBTUQpRl7eFUi4Vz8xJJeA.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/qPZOrHwcnJbEjeibsxSBTUQpRl7eFUi4Vz8xJJeA.png\"></p></li><li><p>Input PS number and hit Enter.</p></li><li><p>Under ‘Description of Service’, if charging for Disbursement, select ‘Adjustment of Disbursement’. If charging for Management Fees, select ‘Adjustment of Management Fee’.</p></li><li><p>Input amount to be charged under ‘Rate’.</p></li><li><p>Under ‘Detail’, if charging for Disbursement, description: ‘Disbursement Adjustment’. If charging Management Fees, select ‘Management Fee Adjustment’.</p></li><li><p>Click on ‘Charge It!’ and save by pressing <img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/YZSt1DsipUo4JEjMwSEs3KHjiCjArYUvP7edEC1X.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/YZSt1DsipUo4JEjMwSEs3KHjiCjArYUvP7edEC1X.png\"></p></li></ul></li></ol><hr><h1 id=\"determine-whether-quorum-is-achieved-in-the-agm\"><strong>Determine Whether Quorum is Achieved in the AGM</strong></h1><p>A. Quorum is <strong>achieved </strong>means more than 50% of entitlements have attended the AGM</p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/RfvCZxRYjlcWFNFRqjYbRpsm2tpEbFHx5CeZmRK8.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/RfvCZxRYjlcWFNFRqjYbRpsm2tpEbFHx5CeZmRK8.png\"></p><p>Action: to post the levy and/or levy adjustment based on new budget (adopted during AGM)</p><p>B. Quorum is <strong>not achieved</strong> means less than 50% of entitlements attended, and AGM Minutes must state ‘no quorum’.</p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/BV1ppa5GxGOdMYaWMTyFUWkefb4lx1hDElEp9ytm.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/BV1ppa5GxGOdMYaWMTyFUWkefb4lx1hDElEp9ytm.png\"></p><p>     I. If next levy issue date is within 28 days from the AGM date</p><ul><li><p>Example 1 → AGM on 24/09/2025 and next levy issuance on 25-31/08/2025, and due on 01/10/2025.</p></li><li><p>Example 2 → AGM on 24/08/2025 and next levy issuance on 25-31/08/2025, and due on 01/10/2025.</p><ul><li><p>Action:</p><ul><li><p>Post old rate for 01/10/2025 levy period* and</p></li><li><p>Post new rate for subsequent levy periods*</p></li><li><p>Post adjustment levy (if any)</p></li></ul></li></ul><p>II. If next levy issue date is on or greater than 28 days from the AGM date</p><ul><li><p> Example → AGM on 24/07/2025 and next levy issuance on 25-31/08/2025, and due on 01/10/2025.</p><ul><li><p>Action:</p><ul><li><p>Post new rate for 01/10/2025 levy period* and</p></li><li><p>Post adjustment levy (if any)</p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Levy period: </strong>Quarterly, bi-annually or annually as stated in the AGM minutes</p></li><li><p><strong>Levy issue date:</strong> 5 weeks before levy due date</p></li></ul><hr><h1 id=\"post-levies-on-stratamaster\">Post Levies on StrataMaster</h1><ul><li><p>Go to</p><p> <img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/GEmIWN7EaCtmVHBa5N6qu8gVFj04U8VQJWBF0zKt.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/GEmIWN7EaCtmVHBa5N6qu8gVFj04U8VQJWBF0zKt.png\"></p></li><li><p>Select</p><p> <img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/MRmANFky5y4TO8PqjRdC8fKhyUEMvj0zCbewTtrE.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/MRmANFky5y4TO8PqjRdC8fKhyUEMvj0zCbewTtrE.png\"></p></li><li><p>Input PS number and press Enter</p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/jDoSlsCMegxlmJxzEAYrt1xMbg3YUot6U6j9RDVX.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/jDoSlsCMegxlmJxzEAYrt1xMbg3YUot6U6j9RDVX.png\"></p><ul><li><p>Select Standard Levy, applies to Levy Adjustment too.</p></li><li><p><strong>First instalment due date </strong>→  ’Enter the Levy due date in ‘First instalment due date’.</p></li><li><p><strong>Instalment Frequency </strong>→  If OC collect levies quarterly/bi-annually, select it under ‘Instalment Frequency’.</p><ul><li><p>Refer to the ‘Budgets &amp; Contributions’ section in AGM Minutes to confirm Instalment Frequency. Below example is quarterly.</p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/3baDXw1eAZMN3cx1FS0iJQkV7Trnm1cW9V2ocx0b.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/3baDXw1eAZMN3cx1FS0iJQkV7Trnm1cW9V2ocx0b.png\"></p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Number of instalments</strong> and <strong>Advanced</strong></p><ul><li><p>If posting levy for more than one period, tick ‘Advanced’ and change ‘Number of instalments’ to no. of periods to be posted.</p></li><li><p>If not, leave ‘Advanced’ unticked and set ‘Number of Instalments’ to 1.</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Amount to raise – Admin</strong> &amp; <strong>Amount to raise – Maintenance </strong>→  the amount here is based on annual budget.</p><ul><li><p>Example: If posting levy for one quarter only, divide these amounts by 4. These amounts are GST inclusive!</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Description</strong> →  follow the wording formatting as shown above.</p></li><li><p><strong>Date of determination </strong>→  AGM date (step 1).</p></li><li><p><strong>Levy year </strong>→  Financial Year of the OC. Refer to the ‘Budgets &amp; Contributions’ section in AGM Minutes.</p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/Hkh4W9Ntv3DByni9W5BeWcGFeRC76vNLIxRXXCB1.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/Hkh4W9Ntv3DByni9W5BeWcGFeRC76vNLIxRXXCB1.png\"></p></li><li><p>IF POSTING FOR MORE THAN ONE PERIOD, DO THE FOLLOWING: (If not, ignore this step)</p><ul><li><p>Untick both <img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/xfmyuR4jcfLk9xjztU3oh7agyO1dnfMjukGCasse.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/xfmyuR4jcfLk9xjztU3oh7agyO1dnfMjukGCasse.png\"></p></li><li><p>Change the description for Instalment 2 (and onwards if posting for more than 2 periods).</p><p>IMPORTANT as by default, the description will be the same for all instalments.</p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/hehXMGbTLvYMmWPbzPiVGMXjzwwP0kQfsjXjPa6j.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/hehXMGbTLvYMmWPbzPiVGMXjzwwP0kQfsjXjPa6j.png\"></p></li></ul></li><li><p>Click on <img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/lTjqBpRNoXWeSIdnkiF4ukOW08IJFmlqMFvHhOnN.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/lTjqBpRNoXWeSIdnkiF4ukOW08IJFmlqMFvHhOnN.png\"></p></li><li><p>Proposed is selected by default, DO NOT CHANGE.</p></li><li><p>Save ‘Proposed Levy Posting’ form on Z Drive →  Financial → OC PS Number →  Levy posting.</p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/jNFddJvHLxApfCQaX9LwrrzFy0sb1sIUMUC1s4nZ.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/jNFddJvHLxApfCQaX9LwrrzFy0sb1sIUMUC1s4nZ.png\"></p></li><li><p>Post levies by pressing <img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/QTEriKNkyLzkdcW7xYBrUVfPtVf4mkIJkCe9ttp9.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/QTEriKNkyLzkdcW7xYBrUVfPtVf4mkIJkCe9ttp9.png\"></p></li></ul></li></ul><hr><h1 id=\"update-existing-cover-letter-template-if-available\">Update existing Cover Letter template (if available)</h1><ul><li><p>Only applicable if there’s levy increase/decrease. If not, skip this step entirely.</p></li><li><p>If total levy increase is or greater than 10%, request cover letter from OCM</p></li><li><p>If increase is less than 10% or levy decreases (rarely), make a separate copy of the existing cover letter template and update according to the colour-coded steps below</p></li><li><p>Template location: Z Driveà Financial à OC PS Number à Levy posting.</p></li><li><p>Template file name for cover letter is generally ‘Adjustment Levy due xx/xx/xx’.</p></li><li><p>Details to update in the new copy:</p><ul><li><p>OC PS Number</p></li><li><p>AGM Date</p></li><li><p>Financial Year</p></li><li><p>Period for previous levy notices issued</p></li><li><p>Amount raised (always exclude GST)</p></li><li><p>Levy Adjustment due date</p><p><img src=\"/storage/knowledge-base-images/GwJYJ4WTXc8lyzB9zLeDv4eTd7axHXSG80Iwr9iK.png\" data-id=\"knowledge-base-images/GwJYJ4WTXc8lyzB9zLeDv4eTd7axHXSG80Iwr9iK.png\"></p></li></ul></li></ul>",
                'toc' => [['id' => "update-agm-date-on-stratamaster", 'text' => "Update AGM Date on StrataMaster", 'level' => "H1"], ['id' => "rollover-financial-year-end-date", 'text' => "Rollover Financial Year End Date", 'level' => "H1"], ['id' => "update-mocs-agency-fees-disbursements-amp-management-fees", 'text' => "Update MOCS agency fees (Disbursements &amp; Management Fees)", 'level' => "H1"], ['id' => "determine-whether-quorum-is-achieved-in-the-agm", 'text' => "Determine Whether Quorum is Achieved in the AGM", 'level' => "H1"], ['id' => "post-levies-on-stratamaster", 'text' => "Post Levies on StrataMaster", 'level' => "H1"], ['id' => "update-existing-cover-letter-template-if-available", 'text' => "Update existing Cover Letter template (if available)", 'level' => "H1"]],
                'is_active' => 1,
